Cell["\<\
Formal symbols (or patterns) in the rule's ports are bound by the match, so a \
single rule can rewrite differently-wired occurrences of the same subdiagram.\
\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8ee7f215-d015-4f3f-9a66-7a28e4add76d"],

